# S9-C3h200q: regenerated tangent simplicity at the final Lorentz current

C3h200p restarted the complete current-state action on the C3h200n final
Lorentz current.  This module now evaluates that newly generated response,
rather than transporting the older C3h200o tangent receipt:

```text
C3h200n full Lorentz EL on the final actual
→ exact algebraic and cross-contact BF-momentum transport
→ all 18 Lorentz action coordinates of V(Ufinal) vanish
→ the fresh response is tangent to simplicity
→ the genuine time derivatives of A(Ufinal, 0) realize that tangent.
```

The coordinate replay is cross-epoch producer consistency: the C3h200n
connection was itself generated by the Lorentz action equation.  The final
actual-level tangent statement is nevertheless a fresh acceptance on the
C3h200p actual and does not reuse the older actual's tangent theorem.  The
P286 statements at the end are respectively producer consistency and its
structural temporal projection; neither is counted as an independent
constraint or as positive-time propagation.
-/

